; A script, not a module: it has no `(module …)` header, so the namespace index
; does not list it, although the string below spells the header of a module the
; package imports. (The index took the first `(module ` anywhere in a file, and
; this file failed every import of pfapp.clamp with a duplicate namespace.)
(defn main [] (-> i64)
  (println "(module pfapp.clamp) is only text here")
  0)
